       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    TINVOICE.
       AUTHOR.        LS BAKER/ KURT MOVSESIAN.
       INSTALLATION.  GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER CO.
       DATE-WRITTEN.  APRIL 19, 1983.

      *D* * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *
      *D*     INVOICE PROCESSING.                                     *
      *D*                                                             *
      *D*     THIS PROGRAM IS THE INVOICE CREATE PROGRAM THAT ACCEPTS *
      *D*     INVOICE DATA AND USES PO AND RECEIVING SLIP INFORMATION *
      *D*     TO VERIFY THE INVOICE INFORMATION.                      *
      *D* * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *
      *C* CHANGES
      *C*
      *C* JUNE 1992   CR KALMAN
      *C* ADDED A WARNING MESSAGE THAT REQUIRES THE USER TO CONFIRM
      *C* THEY WANT TO MANUALY ENTER AN INVOICE AGAINST AN
      *C* INVOICELESS PO.
      *C*
      *C* JULY 21, 1992  CR KALMAN   REQUEST: 6195
      *C* ADDED EDIT TO MAKE SURE THAT AN ITEM IS NOT ENTERED
      *C* WITH ZERO DOLLARS.
      *C*
      *C* JULY 22, 1992  CR KALMAN   REQUEST:
      *C* ADDED CODE TO STOP THE USER FROM PAYING AN INVOICE AGAINST
      *C* A REQUIREMENT ORDER.  THIS CAN BE OVERRIDDEN BY SETTING
      *C* MPLTINFO-INV-REQ-PO TO "X" (ON "PREG"). CHANGING IT TO "X"
      *C* WILL ALLOW THE PLANT TO PAY INVOICES AGAINST REQUIREMENT
      *C* ORDERS.
      *C*
      *C* NOVEMBER 6, 1992  CR KALMAN  REQUEST: 6268
      *C* ADDED CODE TO LOWER ACCRUED TAXES BY THE DISCOUNT AMOUNT
      *C* IF THE DISCOUNT TAX SWITCH IN MPLTINFO IS EQUAL TO "Y".
      *C* THE DISCOUNTED ACCRUED TAX AMOUNTS WILL SHOW UP ON INV-8.
      *C*
      *C* NOVEMBER 25, 1992    CR  KALMAN   REQ: 6195
      *C* MODIFIED THE EDIT MADE JULY 1, 1992 TO JUST GIVE USER
      *C* A WARNING THAT AN ITEM IS BEING ENTERED WITH ZERO DOLLARS
      *C* INSTEAD OF TOTALLY STOPPING THEM FROM CONTINUING. CAN
      *C* OVERRIDE WARNING BY PRESSING F2.
      *C*
      *C* DECEMBER 04, 1992    CR  KALMAN   NO REQ (AS/400 ONLY)
      *C* LOCKING PROBLEM WAS OCCURING WHEN TRYING TO RESTART AN
      *C* ALREADY PROCESSED INVOICE AND THEN ENTERING TINVMOD
      *C* IMMEDIATELY AFTER.  ADDED HIGH-VALUE START IN
      *C* 631-GET-DINVRCD-LOOP TO FIX PROBLEM.
      *C*
      *C* FEBRUARY 22, 1993    CR  KALMAN   NO REQ (AS/400 ONLY)
      *C* (SEE CHANGE 11/6/92) ACCRUED TAXES WERE BEING LOWERED BY
      *C* THE DISCOUNT AMOUNT FROM THE PO TERMS ONLY. IF USER CHANGED
      *C* TERMS ON INVOICE, THE PO TERMS WERE STILL BEING USED TO
      *C* DISCOUNT ACCRUED TAXES. CHANGED THE PROGRAM TO USE THE TERMS
      *C* IN INV-TERMS FIELD AT THE TIME OF TAX CALCULATION.
      *C*
      *C* CR KALMAN        4/26/94            REQUEST 6490
      *C* REMOVED PORTABLILITY COPYLIBS.
      *C*
      *C* CR KALMAN        5/02/94
      *C* (SEE CHANGE 11/6/92) ACCRUED TAXES WERE NOT BEING PROPERLY
      *C* CALCULATED BECAUSE OF A ROUNDING ERROR. ADDED "ROUNDED"
      *C* PARM TO DISCOUNTED TAX CALCUATION IN 681-GET-ACCRUED-TAX.
      *C*
      *C* CA YODER        12/20/95
      *C* ADDED LOGIC TO AUTOMATICALLY RESET MPLTINFO REGISTER NUMBER
      *C* TO 00001 WHEN THE MAXIMUM NUMBER (99999) IS REACHED.
      *C*
      *C* CA YODER        05/08/96       REQ #94-005
      *C* ALLOWED FOR THE CURRENCY CODE TO BE CHANGED FROM THE PO
      *C* CURRENCY CODE.  THIS IS ONLY PERMITTED IF THE NEW CURRENCY
      *C* IS THE HOME CURRENCY CODE AND THE INVOICE IS A NO-CHECK
      *C* INVOICE.
      *C*
      *C* CA YODER        07/12/96
      *C* MODIFIED FOR CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.
      *C*
      *C* CA YODER        11/13/96
      *C* IF THE PO FIELD WAS LEFT BLANK ON THE "INV-1" SCREEN,
      *C* THE PROGRAM WOULD BLOW UP.  CORRECTED TO DISPLAY A
      *C* MESSAGE INSTEAD.
      *C*
      *C* CA YODER        03/18/97
      *C* DUPLICATE INVOICES WERE NOT BEING CAUGHT IF THE USER WAS
      *C* CONTINUING AN INVOICE ON HOLD.  ADDED LOGIC TO CHECK FOR
      *C* DUPLICATES IN THIS SITUATION.
      *C*
      *C* CA YODER        05/15/97
      *C* ADDED LOGIC TO NOT ALLOW PAYMENT FOR A NON-PAYABLE PO
      *C* (PO FOR STOREROOM ITEMS FOR A FRANCHISE VENDOR).
      *C*
      *C* 06/02/99   CA YODER   (DECATUR REQUEST)
      *C*   EXPANDED TAX RATE PERCENTAGE FROM 2 DECIMAL
      *C*   PLACES TO 4, SO SEVERAL FIELDS HAD TO BE ADJUSTED
      *C*   TO ACCOMMODATE THE CHANGE.
      *C*
      *C* 06/14/99   CA YODER
      *C*   CHANGED OVERRIDE VENDOR SCREEN TO ACCEPT ALPHANUMERIC
      *C*   VENDOR CODES SINCE SYNERGY SAP R/3 NOW GENERATING
      *C*   REMIT-TO VENDOR CODES PREFIXED WITH AN "S".
      *C*

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.
          I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT TAXGST-FILE        ASSIGN TO DISK-TAXGST
                                     FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT  SORT-FILE  ASSIGN TO  DISK-SORT.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZINVOICE-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.
           SELECT MPLTINFO-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
