       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1            PIC X  VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2            PIC X   VALUE "0".
       77  DBOPEN-SW            PIC X           VALUE "N".
       77  CALC-ADDRESS         PIC S9(9)       VALUE ZERO COMP-4.
       77  INVITM-ADDR          PIC S9(9)       VALUE ZERO COMP-4.
       77  READ-CTR             PIC S9(4)       VALUE ZERO COMP-4.
